# Phase 11 hold-SELECT menu from Now Playing (docs/phase11-brief.md
# section 3.3; owner photo hold-select-popup-np-b): Add to On-The-Go /
# Browse Album / Browse Artist / Cancel under the normal header. Browse
# Album leaves the menu and Now Playing, then shows the album's songs;
# MENU returns to the list Now Playing was opened from (⚠️ H2).
# Playback goes on throughout.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-hold-np.script
# needs: library
# golden: skip
#
# Needs Q's one call in nowplaying.c (ui_hold_open_np(), its hold-SELECT
# branch); without it the hold does nothing and the shots stay on Now
# Playing.

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
wait_db 30000

key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +3 300        # "Songs"  [Compilations off: P11]
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +2 300        # "Amber Garden"
wait 400
key SELECT          # plays, Now Playing
wait 1500
hold SELECT 1500    # the hold menu
wait 600
shot hold_np        # next to hold-select-popup-np-b
wheel +1 300        # Browse Album
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1000
shot browse_album   # "Night Ferry": its songs
expect_playing 1000
key MENU            # back to Songs: Now Playing has left
wait 800
shot back_songs
quit
